          "writerAnswerText": "**No.** Under the 2022 NYC Mechanical Code, a listed and labeled domestic ductless range hood need not discharge outdoors when it is installed according to the manufacturer’s instructions and mechanical or natural ventilation is otherwise provided as required by Chapter 4. That is an express exception to the general outdoor-discharge rule, and the facts you stipulated meet its stated conditions (MC §§ 501.3, 505.1).",
